      en: ["The castle has been owned by the state and used as a museum since 1953.", "The Drašković family owned the estate from 1568 until 1944.", "The surrounding forest park covers an area of approximately 87 hectares.", "The Neo-Gothic renovation of the castle took place between 1850 and 1860.", "The museum houses a collection of over 300 weapons from the 15th to 19th centuries.", "The artificial lake was constructed during the 19th-century renovation period."],
