      en: ["First mentioned in official documents in the year 1266", "The miraculous fire that defined its history occurred in 1731", "The chapel's ornate iron screen was handcrafted in 1758", "Votive plaques on the walls contain expressions of gratitude in many languages", "The gate is the only one of the original five entries to Gradec still standing", "The Virgin Mary icon within is considered the protector of Zagreb"],
